SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
Summary: Add a winemetal.dll stub so DXMT's DLLs can load
Category: graphics
Kind: feature
Origin: other
From: dblark 0004-add-winemetal-stub.patch (configure regenerated with autoconf 2.72
 via tools/make_makefiles, as WineHQ's own new-DLL commits do)
Source: https://github.com/dblark/macos-wine-build/blob/71877c1/patches/0004-add-winemetal-stub.patch
Upstream: no
Why: DXMT's d3d11/dxgi import winemetal.dll; the stub lets the builtin load until the
 user drops in DXMT's own winemetal.dll/.so.
Programs: none known
Evidence: Sikarugir 10.0_8: lib/wine/{x86_64,i386}-windows/winemetal.dll, whose only export is
 WineMetalEntry (a stub)
Port: unchanged from 10.0 (only line offsets differ; configure hunks match what
 autoconf would add). No Wine-11 equivalent found: CX 26 has no winemetal stub.
Applies to: wine 11.22

diff --git a/configure b/configure
index dee0e8d..32e8f15 100755
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1625,6 +1625,7 @@ enable_winegstreamer
 enable_winehid_sys
 enable_winemac_drv
 enable_winemapi
+enable_winemetal
 enable_wineoss_drv
 enable_wineps_drv
 enable_wineps16_drv16
@@ -22896,6 +22897,7 @@ wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/winegstreamer enable_winegstreamer
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/winehid.sys enable_winehid_sys
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/winemac.drv enable_winemac_drv
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/winemapi enable_winemapi
+wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/winemetal enable_winemetal
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/wineoss.drv enable_wineoss_drv
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/wineps.drv enable_wineps_drv
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/wineps16.drv16 enable_wineps16_drv16
diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index bd605e0..dceb79c 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3335,6 +3335,7 @@ WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winegstreamer)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winehid.sys)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winemac.drv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winemapi)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winemetal)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/wineoss.drv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/wineps.drv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/wineps16.drv16)
diff --git a/dlls/winemetal/Makefile.in b/dlls/winemetal/Makefile.in
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5f8ab6f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/winemetal/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+MODULE = winemetal.dll
diff --git a/dlls/winemetal/winemetal.spec b/dlls/winemetal/winemetal.spec
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9ccfb1a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/winemetal/winemetal.spec
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+@ stub WineMetalEntry
